%H A063241 William A. Stein, <a href="https://wstein.org/Tables/">The modular forms database</a>
%H A063241 <a href="/index/Rec#order_04">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (1,0,1,-1).
%F A063241 G.f.: 3*x -x^2*(-5-2*x-6*x^2+3*x^3) / ( (1+x+x^2)*(x-1)^2 ). - _R. J. Mathar_, Jul 15 2015
%F A063241 a(n) = 2*n + 4*floor(n/3 - 1/3) + 1. This formula follows from Mathar's generating function. - _Bruno Berselli_, Feb 16 2016
%p A063241 # see A063195
%t A063241 A063241[n_] := 4*Quotient[n - 1, 3] + 2*n + 1; Array[A063241, 60] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 29 2026 *)
